{
  "name": "Shopify Competitor Price Drop & Restock Alerts to Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Shopify Competitor Price & Restock Monitor (Zero-Proxy)\n\nMonitors Shopify stores on a schedule and sends Slack alerts **only when a real change occurs** (`price_drop`, `price_increase`, `restocked`, `out_of_stock`, `new_product`, `discount_started`, or `mapViolation`).\n\n### Setup Steps\n1. Create a free [Apify account](https://apify.com) and copy your API token (`Settings -> Integrations`).\n2. Open **Run Shopify Delta Monitor** and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` in the `Authorization` header.\n3. Edit `storeUrls` in the JSON body to your competitor Shopify store URLs.\n4. Connect your **Slack** credential and choose your alert channel.\n\n**Actor URL:** https://apify.com/maitreya_buddha/shopify-competitor-delta-monitor\n**Cost:** $2.00 / 1,000 real deltas · **$0 on baseline or unchanged runs** · 128 MB RAM · $0 proxy.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Every 6 Hours",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/maitreya_buddha~shopify-competitor-delta-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "memory",
              "value": "256"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"storeUrls\": [\n    \"https://www.allbirds.com\"\n  ],\n  \"stateStoreName\": \"shopify-delta-monitor-state\",\n  \"maxProductsPerStore\": 500,\n  \"minPriceChangePercent\": 3,\n  \"eventTypes\": [\n    \"price_drop\",\n    \"restocked\",\n    \"out_of_stock\",\n    \"new_product\",\n    \"discount_started\"\n  ],\n  \"emitBaselineSummary\": true\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Run Shopify Delta Monitor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.eventType }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.recordType }}",
              "rightValue": "baseline_initialized",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Only Real Delta Events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "C00000000",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "text": "=:rotating_light: *Shopify Competitor Change* (`{{ $json.eventType }}`)\n*Store:* {{ $json.store }}\n*Product:* {{ $json.title }} ({{ $json.variantTitle || 'Default' }})\n*Price:* {{ $json.oldPrice ?? 'N/A' }} -> *{{ $json.newPrice ?? 'N/A' }}* ({{ $json.priceChangePercent ?? 0 }}%)\n*In Stock:* {{ $json.available }}\n*MAP Violation:* {{ $json.mapViolation ? 'YES' : 'No' }}\n*Detected:* {{ $json.detectedAt }}\n*Link:* {{ $json.productUrl }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "b1a2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Send Slack Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
